###
### Add
###
POST {{root}}/api/data/v1/workflows/add
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "environmentId": "{{envId}}",
  "workflowName": "{{wrkName}}"
}

###
### Remove
###
POST {{root}}/api/data/v1/workflows/remove
